SUMMARY:Flag Them Safe: Flag It\, Stop It - by Canadian Council of Muslim
  Women
LOCATION:Shoot for Peace Studios
DESCRIPTION:More info:
  https://www.ccmw.com/event/flag-them-safe-workshop/\n\nHosted by Canadian
  Council of Muslim Women (https://www.ccmw.com)\n\nA dynamic public legal
  education event designed to inform\, empower\, and promote community
  safety. Through accessible and practical guidance\, participants will
  gain a clearer understanding of how red flag laws function\, including
  emergency firearm removal processes\, as well as other key legal
  protections.
END:VEVENT
