SUMMARY: AAA#1 Best Comedy Show Toronto :)
DESCRIPTION:The funniest pro comedians in Toronto\, every second Friday o
 f the month at Tallboys! Featuring:\n\nNATALIE NORMAN (Just For Laughs\, 
 Winnipeg Comedy Festival)\nBITA JOUDAKI (This Hour Has 22 Minutes\, Child
 ren Ruin Everything)\nMEG MACKAY (Don't Even\, Baroness Von Sketch Show\,
  JFL)\nNATHAN HARE (JFL Originals\, CBC The New Wave of Stand Up)\nSASHKA
  DC (JFL Originals)\nHosted by REBECCA PAYNE (JFL Toronto\, Toronto Sketc
 hfest)!\n\nTICKETS: https://www.eventbrite.ca/e/friday-standup-comedy-aaa
 1-best-standup-show-tickets-1986784202031?aff=oddtdtcreator https://www.e
 ventbrite.ca/e/friday-standup-comedy-aaa1-best-standup-show-tickets-19867
 84202031?aff=oddtdtcreator\n\nFriday\, April 10 @ 8:00 p.m. (doors at 7:5
 0 p.m.)\, at Tallboys\, 838 Bloor St W\, Toronto.\n\nAccessibility: Theat
 re space is in the basement\, down 10 stairs with handrail\, as are washr
 ooms. Additional step down into theatre space.\n\n\nToronto's best monthl
 y standup comedy show! AAA#1 Best Standup Comedy Show Toronto\, the secon
 d Friday night of the month\, always at Toronto's best hidden comedy club
 \, Tallboys! If you are looking for "things to do in Toronto" look no fur
 ther! See you on Friday\, April 10 @ 8PM!
CATEGORIES:Comedy,Tallboys
