DESCRIPTION:More info: https://www.instagram.com/p/DW14CQ0EZDL/\n\nHosted
  by CUPE 5399\, Harm Reduction Advocacy Collective\, and Toronto Overdose
  Prevention Society ()\n\nJoin this rally to save our supervised
  consumption sites at Moss Park and Fred Victor. Come hear from incredible
  speaers\, share the space and a meal\, and fight to stop the defunding of
  supervised consumption sites in Ontario. Harm reduction is love!
