SUMMARY:Saturday Movie: The Lion\, the Witch and the Wardrobe
DTSTART;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260411T180000Z
DTEND;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260411T203000Z
UID:69bad3374dacf581ff82df23@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Enjoy a library screening of\nThe Chronicles of Narnia: The L
 ion\, the Witch and the Wardrobe.\nLucy\, Edmund\, Susan and Peter enter a
  magical wardrobe only to discover the world of Narnia on the other side. 
 There\, the children discover a charming\, once-peaceful land that has bee
 n turned into a world of eternal winter by the evil White Witch. Aided by 
 the wise lion Aslan\, the children lead Narnia into a climactic battle to 
 rid the land of the Witch's glacial powers forever. 2h 29m with a short in
 termission. Drop-in\, no registration necessary.
LOCATION:Danforth/Coxwell\, 2nd Floor Program Room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69bad3374dacf581ff82df23
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library
END:VEVENT
