 or (cash only please)\nIncludes: **Music Bingo\,** treats\, reserved room/
 seating\, lots of laughs and plenty of fun people to play the game with)\n
 \\*or e-transfer in advance to **steveflemming11@gmail.com**\n\\-\\-\\-\\-
