 m\n\\*Music Bingo will start shortly after that\n(Invite your friends out 
 too if you like)\n\n**Parking Available:**\n\\*Plenty of free street parki
 ng on Eglinton and (Residential area south/east of venue for free)\n**Clos
 e to Subway Station:**\n\\*Also right beside the Yonge/Eglinton subway sta
 tion
