DESCRIPTION:More info: https://www.ttcriders.ca/bookclub2026\n\nHosted by
  TTC Riders (https://www.ttcriders.ca)\n\nJoin TTC Riders to read and
  discuss Jarrett Walker’s Human Transit: How Clearer Thinking About
  Public Transit Can Enrich Our Communities and Our Lives. There will be a
  brief recap of the book followed by questions and discussion. Everyone
  welcome\, even if you haven’t completed the readings!
