DESCRIPTION:More info: https://www.instagram.com/p/DW328SJjYOO/\n\nHosted
  by RewildersTO (https://rewildersto.ca/)\n\nIt’s still too early to
  start gardening — many pollinators are still overwintering in stems and
  soil — but you can start getting gardens ready. Join a community
  clean-up along the 1km Pollinator Pathway — walk the route\, tidy up
  the spaces\, and connect with neighbours.
END:VEVENT
