SUMMARY:Equal Pay Day Rally - by Ontario Coalition for Better Childcare
LOCATION:361 University Ave
DESCRIPTION:More info:
  https://childcareontario.org/equal-pay-day-2026/\n\nHosted by Ontario
  Coalition for Better Childcare
  (https://www.childcareontario.org/)\n\nEqual Pay Day symbolizes how much
  longer into 2026 the average woman must work to earn what the average man
  did in 2025. Without care work\, workers can’t work\, but women’s
  underpaid care work continues to act as the shock absorber for the rest
  of the economy. Join this rally to hear about how you can support care
  workers!
END:VEVENT
