SUMMARY:3D Design with Spline
DTSTART;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260415T220000Z
DTEND;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260415T233000Z
UID:69bea3828089f23c6763a999@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Spline is an easy to use 3D design tool that lets you create\,
  model and animate directly in your browser. In this class\, you will expl
 ore basic tools and use them to build your own 3D Music Note App Icon from
  start to finish.\nNote: Please create a free Spline account at\nspline.de
 sign\nbefore the session begin.\nThis program is designed for adults and t
 eens\, but children aged 10–12 are also welcome to register.
LOCATION:Scarborough Civic Centre
