UID:20594-1776331800-1776351600@torontounion.ca
SUMMARY:Union Samples : L'Oreal
DESCRIPTION:Street harassment is the no.1 concern women face daily. Did you know that 81% of women have experienced street harassment\, yet only 23% saw someone intervene? This situation impacts women in ways beyond psychological safety—fundamental rights are at stake\, leading to many missed opportunities. \n\n1 out of 3 women have turned down a job opportunity due to the fear of street harassment.\n1 out of 2 women limit going out for the fear of street harassment.\n\nL’Oréal Paris\, the no.1 beauty brand in the world\, wants to empower women by providing the tools to safely react when they are a witness or a victim of street harassment. We invite everyone to learn the 5D methodology training to help build a world where everyone can walk the streets with confidence. \n  \nHours may vary\, sampling might start later or be cut short due to sample availability; breaks will be taken throughout the day. Guests are not permitted to stand or wait near the kiosk during these times.\nWe ask everyone to remain respectful and polite to our staff at all times. Failure to follow these guidelines will result in being denied a sample.
URL:https://torontounion.ca/event/union-samples-loreal/2026-04-16/
LOCATION:York Union Samples Kiosk\, 65 Front Street West\, Toronto\, ON\, M5R 1V9\, Canada
CATEGORIES:Union Samples
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://torontounion.ca/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/york-union-samples-thumb.jpeg
END:VEVENT
