SUMMARY:Workers’ Justice: A Community-Based Course on Rights and Action -
  by Jane Finch Centre
LOCATION:Jane-Finch area
DESCRIPTION:More info:
  https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSedR2h3DeVm62E5QiU3n74jMhG5bzBww
 7YB4lmR181d-kE9lQ/viewform\n\nHosted by Jane Finch Centre
  (https://www.janefinchcentre.org)\n\nSession 1 of a free\, in-person
  8-session course for workers and community members in Jane-Finch\,
  Rexdale\, and Northwest Toronto. This program is especially for
  racialized workers\, non-unionized workers\, youth and first-time
  workers\, and newcomers. Dinner and childcare provided!
