SUMMARY:Abolition Pub-Ed: Imagining Indigenous Futurisms - by Disability
  Justice Network of Ontario
LOCATION:Virtual
DESCRIPTION:More info:
  https://djno-ca.zoom.us/meeting/register/0kB8rmCyR2mTnmxkMHBOIQ#/registra
 tion\n\nHosted by Disability Justice Network of Ontario
  (https://www.djno.ca/)\n\nExplore Indigenous futurisms as a valid
  direction for creating justice. Learn what an Indigenous futurism is and
  how we can work together to build ideas and actions that lead towards
  permanent overhaul of systems that affect social justice.
END:VEVENT
