DTEND;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260417T000000Z
UID:696bd2d77d180d0d483093d1@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Come and join us on the third Thursday of every other month to
  discuss a variety of books. Everyone is welcome! Drop in\, no registratio
 n required.\nThis year we are reading:\nFebruary 19 -\nThe Strangers\nby 
 Katherena Vermette\nApril 16 -\nBig Little Lies\nby Liane Moriarty\nJun
 e 18 -\nOn the Ravine\nby Vincent Lam\nSeptember 17 -\nTomorrow\, and To
 morrow\, and Tomorrow\nby Gabrielle Zevin\nNovember 19 -\nSmall Things L
 ike These\nby Claire Keegan
LOCATION:Brookbanks\, Auditorium
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/696bd2d77d180d0d483093d1
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library
END:VEVENT
