SUMMARY:The Globe and Mail at Union Station
DESCRIPTION:Join The Globe and Mail at Union Station on Tuesday\, April 21\, 2026 for free limited edition merchandise\, complimentary newspapers and special offers. Discover trusted Canadian reporting on the stories shaping your world. \nHours may vary\, sampling might start later or be cut short due to sample availability; breaks will be taken throughout the day. Guests are not permitted to stand or wait near the kiosk during these times. \nWe ask everyone to remain respectful and polite to our staff at all times. Failure to follow these guidelines will result in being denied a sample.
URL:https://torontounion.ca/event/the-globe-and-mail-at-union-station/
LOCATION:Bay Union Samples Kiosk\, 65 Front Street West\, Toronto\, ON\, M5R 1V9\, Canada
