UID:69cc2740129f12743835a82c@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:After building your editing skills in parts one and two\, this
  session will focus on refining your final video skills through colour cor
 rection and audio editing.\nLearn how to enhance your footage using colour
  tools to adjust exposure\, contrast\, and white balance\, and explore col
 our grading techniques to give your videos a consistent and professional l
 ook.\nWork with audio by adjusting levels\, removing background noise\, an
 d adding effects to improve overall sound quality. You’ll also learn how
  to balance music\, dialogue\, and sound effects within your project.\nBy 
 the end of this session\, you’ll be able to polish your video projects w
 ith clean audio and professional colour\, ready for export and sharing.\nA
 ges 13+\nRegistration is required for this class.\nInformation Collection 
 Notice:\nThe personal information on this form is collected by the Toronto
  Public Library under the Public Libraries Act\, sections 20(a)\, 20(c)\, 
 and 20(d). The information will only be used for event and program registr
 ation\, delivery and evaluation. Questions about how the library handles y
