X-SOURCE-ID:tpl_events
SUMMARY:Digital Literacy Jeopardy!
DTSTART;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260425T183000Z
DTEND;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260425T193000Z
UID:69aa04341e64afd01e601713@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:This is a digital literacy program for kids! Participants will
  work in teams to answer Jeopardy-style questions.\nCategories will includ
 e:\nDigital Literacy 101\nOnline Safety (privacy\, cyberbullying\, online 
 ethics\, etc)\nFake News\nBalanced Screen Time (stats\, mental health\, et
 c.)\nCool Concepts (cool\, futuristic things with digital lit e.g.\, AI)\n
 There will be five questions ranging from 100 to 500 points for each categ
 ory\, as well as tiebreaker questions at the end. Have fun learning about 
 these important topics while playing this Jeopardy-style game!\nThis is a 
 program for kids ages 8 - 12!\nDrop-in!
LOCATION:Morningside\, Program Room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69aa04341e64afd01e601713
