BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"City of Toronto Festivals & Events": "https://www.rcmusic.com/events-and-performances/danilo-perez-john-patitucci-and-brian-blade"}
X-SOURCE-ID:toronto_festivals
SUMMARY:Danilo Pérez\, John Patitucci\, and Brian Blade
DTSTART;TZID="UTC-04:00";VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260425T200000
DTEND;TZID="UTC-04:00";VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260425T200000
UID:fb6be8291aa4f40f37b573ee4e69ed8d@toronto.ca
DESCRIPTION:The rhythm section of Wayne Shorter’s legendary quartet kick
  off the night and joings a local Toronto big band for the premiere of Pé
 rez’s new work\, co-commissioned by the Royal Conservatory of Music.\n\n
 As a solo artist and as a collaborator with jazz giants from Dizzy Gillesp
 ie to Wayne Shorter\, for over three decades\, Grammy-winning Panamanian p
 ianist-composer Danilo Pérez has been lauded as one of the most creative 
 forces in contemporary music. With jazz as the anchoring foundation\, Pér
 ez’s global jazz music is a blend of Panamanian roots\, Latin American f
 olk music\, West African rhythms\, and European impressionism\, promoting 
 music as a borderless and multidimensional bridge between all people.\n\nA
 fter the concert\, enjoy a beverage and more music at the Postlude Perform
 ance in the Leslie and Anna Dan Galleria.\n\nCategories: Arts/Exhibits\, L
 ive Performances\, Music
LOCATION:Koerner Hall\, Royal Conservatory of Music\, 273 Bloor St W\, Tor
 onto\, ON\, M5S 1W2
URL:https://www.rcmusic.com/events-and-performances/danilo-perez-john-pati
 tucci-and-brian-blade
X-SOURCE:City of Toronto Festivals & Events
END:VEVENT
