DTEND;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260427T203000Z
UID:69b05ee919c54125aa030611@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Looking for something to do after school? Come out to our Afte
 r School Club and learn new things\, make stuff\, meet other kids and have
  fun! For ages 6-12.\nSnacks are offered during the After School Club for 
 participants. Ingredient lists will be available. Snacks are generously su
 pported\, in part\, by donors. Snacks will be available starting at 3:30.\
 nInformation Collection Notice:\nThe personal information on this form is 
 collected by the Toronto Public Library under the Public Libraries Act\, s
 ections 20(a)\, 20(c)\, and 20(d). The information will only be used for e
