DESCRIPTION:Chef Yumiko Kobayashi will provide a brief cultural history ab
 out "Furutsu Sandos"\, or Japanese fruit sandwiches\, then lead a hands-on
  demonstration and workshop to make "Furutsu Sandos” consisting of fresh
  fruit fillings\, bread and whipping cream. All ingredients to be provide
 d and prepped by the chef.\nFood allergy notice: Please be aware that food
  will be used in this program that contains gluten and dairy. Certain food
  ingredients may cause allergic reactions in some people.\n15 participants
  maximum. First come\, first served.\nThis program is part of Youth Hub se
 rvice. Youth Hubs are a welcoming place for teens after school and in the 
