SUMMARY:Union Samples : Benefiber
DESCRIPTION:Benefiber is a clear\, tasteless prebiotic fibre supplement that dissolves completely into your favourite foods and drinks\, making it simple to support daily gut health anytime\, anywhere. At Union Station\, the pop-up brings this convenience directly to commuters with a quick\, on-the-go experience that fits seamlessly into their daily routine.
