DESCRIPTION:Attend the Meeting: Members of the public can attend Scarboro
 ugh Community Council meetings in person at the Scarborough Civic Centre 
 or watch live via the City of Toronto's YouTube Channel at http://youtube
 .com/TorontoCityCouncilLive\n\nMake a Deputation (Speak at the Meeting): 
 To speak at a meeting\, register in advance by emailing scc@toronto.ca ma
 ilto:scc@toronto.ca or calling (416) 392-7033. Include your name\, contac
 t information\, and the agenda item you wish to address. Registration dea
 dline: 4:30 p.m. the business day before the meeting.\n\nSubmit Written C
 omments: Email scc@toronto.ca mailto:scc@toronto.ca . Clearly reference t
 he agenda item number and title in your submission.\n\nView Agendas & Min
 utes: toronto.ca/council http://toronto.ca/council\n\nGeneral Inquiries: 
 311 | (416) 392-2489 | 311@toronto.ca mailto:311@toronto.ca\n\nAccessibil
 ity Accommodations: accessibility@toronto.ca mailto:accessibility@toronto
 .ca | (416) 392-5431\n\nStay informed on Ward 23 news — subscribe to Coun
 cillor Myers' newsletter at jamaalmyers.com http://jamaalmyers.com
