DESCRIPTION:Take a break and join us in the Youth Hub for Mindful Colourin
 g! We will provide a variety of colouring pages\, markers\, pencil crayons
 \, and your own space where you can unwind.  All materials will be provi
 ded\; this is a drop-in program.\nThis program is part of Youth Hub servic
 e. Youth Hubs are a welcoming place for teens after school and in the summ
 er\, where helpful staff are always available. Free\, nutritious snacks a
 re offered daily. Drop by a branch with a\nYouth Hub\nor call the branch 
 to find out more.
