DESCRIPTION:Join us for a beginner friendly workshop where participants wi
 ll get the opportunity to learn to use Tinkercad software to make their ve
 ry own keychain.\nAll completed keychains will be 3D printed by staff for
  pickup at a later date.\nThis program is part of Youth Hub service. Youth
  Hubs are a welcoming place for teens after school and in the summer\, whe
