UID:69b9660f1e64afd01e62b487@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a cozy afternoon of creativity and cinema as TPL p
 lays the feature film Spider-man Across the Spider-Verse. Bring your knitt
 ing\, embroidery\, sketching\, crochet\, whatever craft brings you joy\, a
 nd settle in for a movie night with the lights up just enough to keep your
  hands busy while you watch Miles Morales take on the Spider-Verse!\nWheth
 er you’re a seasoned maker or looking for a low-key\, communal night out
 \, this is the perfect way to connect\, unwind\, and create.\nInformation 
 Collection Notice:\nThe personal information on this form is collected by 
 the Toronto Public Library under the Public Libraries Act\, sections 20(a)
 \, 20(c)\, and 20(d). The information will only be used for event and prog
 ram registration\, delivery and evaluation. Questions about how the librar
 y handles your information can be directed to Answerline staff at\nanswerl
