SUMMARY:Survivalist Series: Introduction to Firecraft
DESCRIPTION:Wilderness Union Toronto - Outdoor Adventure and Hiking Club\n
 **Please note the only way to register for this adventure is on [our websi
 te.](https://www.wildernessunion.com/adventures/fire-craft-intro-3)**\n\n*
 **Discover the ancient art of safely creating and maintaining fire without
  lighters or matches!***\n\nFor thousands of years\, fire has been our gre
 atest ally for warmth\, safety\, cooking\, and survival. But in the wild\,
  fire doesn’t come easy. It takes knowledge\, patience\, and the right t
 echnique.\n\nWe are back for the third installment of this popular course 
 to teach you the beautiful art of fire. You’ll begin to master the craft
  with hands-on guidance from our expert firecraft instructor - guide Kyle.
 \n\nYou'll be shown and encouraged to practice:\n1\\. Ferrocerium rod tech
 niques with multiple tinders\n2\\. Traditional flint & steel fire lighting
 \n3\\. The art of hand\\-drill friction fire\nThis course will give you th
 e foundation to create fire anywhere\, anytime.\n\n**Included:** Your own 
 high-quality ferro rod to take home and keep the fire burning wherever you
  go.\n\n**Who It’s For:** This course is for beginners and intermediate 
 survivalists alike. Bring your curiosity\, a willingness to learn\, and a 
 love of getting outside. This is an amazing opportunity not only to learn 
 from our expert\, but it's a fun\, practical lesson at a uniquely low pric
 e.\n\n**About this series:** The Survivalist Series is an expert-led set o
 f courses designed to develop applicable and life-saving skills in the out
 doors. Keep your eyes peeled for more courses on many other topics coming 
 soon!\n\n**Due to the cost of parking at Bronte Creek\, WU transport is re
 commended for this course.**\n\n**Highlights**\n**Ancient techniques:** Le
 arn unique firecraft techniques from long ago that do not need matches or 
 a lighter.\n**Survivalist skills training:** Develop essential skills to s
 urvive and thrive in the wild.\n**Fire kit included:** Every participant g
 ets this kit including a ferro rod and variety of tinders.\n\n**Event cost
 : $95+HST - optional transport available.**\n**Register [here.](https://ww
 w.wildernessunion.com/adventures/fire-craft-intro-3)**\n\n**About Wilderne
 ss Union**\nWilderness Union is deliberate about building an outdoors comm
 unity that connects you to the life-changing magic of the outdoors and hel
 ps you find your people.\n\nMembers range from 20-40 years old. The group 
 is a mix of GTA locals and newcomers to Toronto from within Canada and abr
 oad.\n\nAttendance numbers on Meetup don't reflect our actual event attend
 ance - we typically have 15-20 community members at each event. Large enou
 gh that there's someone new to meet but small enough that it's not overwhe
 lming!\n\n***Learn more at our website [www.wildernessunion.com](https://w
 ww.wildernessunion.com/)***
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/wildernessunion/events/314152973/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260406T201142Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260406T201142Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
