 utube.com/TorontoCityCouncilLive\n\nMake a Deputation (Speak at the Meeti
 ng): To speak at a meeting\, register in advance by emailing taac@toronto
 .ca mailto:taac@toronto.ca or calling (416) 392-7033. Include your name\,
  contact information\, and the agenda item you wish to address\; registra
 tion deadline: 4:30 p.m. the business day before the meeting.\n\nSubmit W
 ritten Comments: Email taac@toronto.ca mailto:taac@toronto.ca . Clearly r
 eference the agenda item number and title in your submission.\n\nView Age
 ndas & Minutes: toronto.ca/council http://toronto.ca/council\n\nAccessibi
 lity Accommodations: accessibility@toronto.ca mailto:accessibility@toront
 o.ca | (416) 392-5431\n\nStay informed on Ward 23 news — subscribe to Cou
 ncillor Myers' newsletter at http://jamaalmyers.com\n\n
