SUMMARY:If I Ruled the World: Activism through Poetry
DTSTART;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260505T200000Z
DTEND;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260505T213000Z
UID:698cb86bcbf6405d356711e6@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:In this workshop led by Coach Joshua Watkis\, participants wil
 l learn tools for expressing their social views in poetry\, including effe
 ctive storytelling\, maintaining a singular theme\, and mastering techniqu
 es for powerful public performance.
LOCATION:North York Central Library\, Teen Zone
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/698cb86bcbf6405d356711e6
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library
END:VEVENT
