X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Toronto Public Library": "https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69caf69a81b67dfe32b000ae"}
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Toronto Public Library": "https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6961598676261f280063800d"}
X-SOURCE-ID:tpl_events
SUMMARY:After School Club
DTSTART;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260507T200000Z
DTEND;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260507T210000Z
UID:6961598676261f280063800d@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Looking for something to do after school? Come out to our Afte
 r School Club and learn new things\, make stuff\, meet other kids and have
  fun! For ages\n6-12.\nSnacks are offered during the After School Club for
  participants. Ingredient lists will be available. Snacks are generously s
 upported\, in part\, by donors.\nDrop in\, no registration required.
LOCATION:Bloor/Gladstone
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6961598676261f280063800d
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Toronto Public Library": "https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69711f61c967cb4120833b6c"}
X-SOURCE-ID:tpl_events
SUMMARY:Youth Hub: Crafty Thursdays
DTSTART;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260507T200000Z
DTEND;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260507T220000Z
UID:69711f61c967cb4120833b6c@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us in the Youth Hub every Thursday for a series of crafti
 ng activities like painting\, clay sculpting\, sewing and embroidery\, res
 in art\, jewelry making\, perler beads\, block printing\, and more! Check 
 tpl.ca or our monthly calendar for the activity of the week. All material
 s provided.\nThis program is part of Youth Hub service. Youth Hubs are a w
 elcoming place for teens after school and in the summer\, where helpful st
 aff are always available. Free\, nutritious snacks are offered daily. Dr
 op by a branch with a\nYouth Hub\nor call the branch to find out more.
LOCATION:Eatonville
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69711f61c967cb4120833b6c
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library
END:VEVENT
