DTEND;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260507T210000Z
UID:695470a96f926136000d7c8a@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Drop in for a casual game of chess in a welcoming environment.
  Improve your chess skills or learn how to play. Sets are provided. All ag
 es. Drop-in.
