 crafts\, building with LEGO\, and making new friends — with something di
 fferent every week! For kids 6–12.\nDrop-in\, no registration required.\
 nMarch 24: Children's Graphic Novel Book Club\nApril 7: LEGO\nApril 14: 
 LEGO\nApril 21: Robotics\nApril 28: Children's Graphic Novel Book Club
