SUMMARY:Henna Art with Hina
DTSTART;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260516T180000Z
DTEND;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260516T200000Z
UID:69cb0f0cad384e40edb7da4f@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate Asian Heritage Month and discover the art of henna\,
  decorative designs which are created on a person's body\, using a paste o
 f natural organic henna.  Observe and enjoy the henna application and lear
 n about its history\, recipe and traditions.  Led by Henna Artist\, Hina Y
 asir.\nNo registration required\, all ages\, first come\, first serve! Com
 e by early to secure your spot\, taking place on the main floor of the lib
 rary.
LOCATION:Parkdale
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69cb0f0cad384e40edb7da4f
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library
END:VEVENT
