X-SOURCE-ID:tpl_events
SUMMARY:Creating With Cops
DTSTART;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260516T180000Z
DTEND;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260516T190000Z
UID:69b08cca4dacf581ff81075a@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Meet your 53 Division Neighbourhood Community Officers while m
 aking some wonderful creations to take home!  Free snacks and drinks are 
 provided after the craft\; ingredients are listed on the labels.  This pr
 ogram is presented by Toronto Police Services and is for children ages 6 a
 nd up.\nUpcoming projects include:\nSaturday\, March 21 - Painting Flowerp
 ots\nSaturday\, April 18 - Pom-pom Rabbits\nSaturday\, May 16 -- To Be Ann
 ounced\nCraft projects are subject to change without notice.\nInformation
  Collection Notice:\nThe personal information on this form is collected by
  the Toronto Public Library under the Public Libraries Act\, sections 20(a
 )\, 20(c)\, and 20(d). The information will only be used for event and pro
 gram registration\, delivery and evaluation. Questions about how the libra
 ry handles your information can be directed to Answerline staff at\nanswer
 line@tpl.ca\n\, 416-397-5981\, 789 Yonge Street\, Toronto ON M4W 2G8.
LOCATION:Yorkville\, Art Gallery
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69b08cca4dacf581ff81075a
