DTSTART;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260518T193000Z
DTEND;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260518T203000Z
UID:698cb1f0b0595799c09c4aa4@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Looking for something to do after school? Come out to our Afte
 r School Club and learn new things\, make stuff\, meet other kids and have
  fun! Spend your afternoon exploring STEM activities\, creating fun craft
 s\, and building with LEGO.\nSnacks are offered during the program! Ingred
 ient lists will be available.
LOCATION:Woodview Park\, Program Room
