DTSTART;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260518T200000Z
DTEND;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260518T210000Z
UID:69cd4cae1e64afd01e661e3d@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Come make new friends\, and enjoy reading Stuart Little by E.
 B White. After we finish the book we will be watching the movie. Book club
  will start April 20th.
