DESCRIPTION:Participants will get an introduction to Da Vinci Resolve's co
 lour grading page becoming familiar with the general workflow using the no
 de editor and tools such as the colour wheels\, white balancing\, curves\,
  masks and scopes.\nComputers will be provided for this program\nInformati
 on Collection Notice:\nThe personal information on this form is collected 
