 rontoCityCouncilLive http://youtube.com/TorontoCityCouncilLive\n\nMake a 
 Deputation (Speak at the Meeting): To speak at a meeting\, register in ad
 vance by emailing scc@toronto.ca mailto:scc@toronto.ca or calling (416) 3
 92-7033. Include your name\, contact information\, and the agenda item yo
 u wish to address. Registration deadline: 4:30 p.m. the business day befo
 re the meeting.\n\nSubmit Written Comments: Email scc@toronto.ca mailto:s
 cc@toronto.ca . Clearly reference the agenda item number and title in you
 r submission.\n\nView Agendas & Minutes: toronto.ca/council http://toront
 o.ca/council\n\nGeneral Inquiries: 311 | (416) 392-2489 | 311@toronto.ca 
 mailto:311@toronto.ca\n\nAccessibility Accommodations: accessibility@toro
 nto.ca mailto:accessibility@toronto.ca | (416) 392-5431\n\nStay informed 
 on Ward 23 news — subscribe to Councillor Myers' newsletter at jamaalmyer
 s.com http://jamaalmyers.com
