DTEND;TZID="UTC-04:00";VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260531T180000
UID:46151d6f6f7fcea51fe1ece528fa554c@toronto.ca
DESCRIPTION:A community-led arts and heavy music festival\, the first of i
 ts kind in the city! \n\nFounded by two lifelong friends\, Toronto-based c
 oncert promoter Denholm Whale and KW Campol of music management company My
 thos and the Perpetual Flame Ministries record label/art house. \n\nDrawin
 g inspiration from European festival stalwarts like Roadburn\, Supersonic\
 , and Amplifest\, we're focused on heavy music as an ethos of collective c
 atharsis more than a dedication to one specific metal subgenre. From burge
 oning artists\, to favorites you never thought would reunite\, to one-off 
 full album sets\, a heavily curated and meticulously planned lineup is the
  festival’s key component. \n\n\nCategories: Live Performances\, Music\,
  Other
LOCATION:Trinity St Paul's\, 427 Bloor St W\, Toronto\, ON\, M5S 1X7
URL:www.preparetheground.com
X-SOURCE:City of Toronto Festivals & Events, Toronto Events (Tockify)
END:VEVENT
