SUMMARY: New Music for Old Hands Concert Series: Lieke van der Voort (joi
 ning us virtually from Germany)
DESCRIPTION:Matinee concert series at Labdara Lithuanian Nursing Home. Ea
 ch concert in this series will premiere a composition performed by the La
 bdara bell choir and Laura Gillis (conductor/pianist). Each composer will
  give a talk and share music with the residents and audience members\, fo
 llowed by a casual social mixer.\n\n2:00pm start time. Free Admission. Re
 serve your spot at Eventbrite. Limited seating available.\n\nMay 30: Liek
 e van der Voort (joining us virtually from Germany)\n\nComposer Lieke van
  der Voort will join us virtually (via Zoom) from studio Dreamcatcher in 
 Germany at our matinee concert series at Labdara Lithuanian Nursing Home.
  Lieke will perform a newly written work for voice and electronics\, and 
 will talk about her experiences as a vocalist\, improvisor and composer. 
 The Labdara bell choir and Laura Gillis (conductor/pianist) will premiere
  Lieke's piece\, Old Flames.\n\nJune 13: Alex Eddington\n\nJune 20: Marti
 n van de Ven\n\nwww.facebook.com/NewMusicForOldHands http://www.facebook.
 com/NewMusicForOldHands
CATEGORIES:Music,Concert,#poweredbyTAC,#BringingTheArtsToLife
