DTEND;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260603T213000Z
UID:69695d5294297d3600a56aa1@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join professional artists in a fun and exciting community base
 d arts program. This workshop offers an introduction into the enriching wo
 rld of art and creativity through poetry\, music\, theatre and visual arts
 . Registration includes all four dates of this series (May 13\, 20\, 27 & 
 June 3).\nAges 9-12\n. Registration required.
