SUMMARY:Pride – Nail Painting and Bracelet Making
DTSTART;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260609T193000Z
DTEND;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260609T203000Z
UID:69d7e3f25c04bc0fc061de08@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Children are welcome to explore self-expression with nail pain
 ting and making beaded bracelets!\nStaff will provide non-toxic nail polis
 h for children and caregivers to apply to their fingernails. Nail polish c
 an easily be removed by either peeling when dry or washing hands in warm w
 ater.\nFor school-aged children and their caregivers.\nDrop-in. No registr
 ation.\nIf your child lives with a disability\, and requires an accessibil
 ity accommodation to participate in this program\, please contact Accessib
 ility Services at accessibleservices@tpl.ca or phone 416-393-7099. Please 
 contact us at least three weeks in advance.
LOCATION:Jones\, Children's Area
