SUMMARY:Beethoven's Ninth Symphony to end the Season (St Andrew Station)
DESCRIPTION:Experience Toronto\nOn **Friday June 12th\, close the 2025/36 
 season with Beethoven's Ninth.** Music Director Gustavo Gimeno brings the 
 season to its close with Beethoven’s triumphant Ninth Symphony. Joined b
 y the Toronto Mendelssohn Choir and a stellar cast of soloists\, this fina
 le delivers the ultimate “Ode to Joy\,” bringing us all together in ju
 bilant celebration. As a subscriber\, I can buy additional seats at the su
 bscriber price for attendees - just message me. My seat is Orchestra Right
  C34. **Purchase your tickets for Beethoven's Ninth on Friday June 12th at
  7:30pm**.\n\n**COST**\nRegular: $77 - 197 includes taxes and fees\n\nRush
 : A limited number of tickets may go on sale at 1pm online\, over the phon
 e\, or in-person at Roy Thomson Hall. Limit 2 per person based on availabi
 lity.\n\nMeetup fee: $5\n\nTicket Policy: Sales are final and non-refundab
 le.\n\n***\n\n**SIGNING-UP**\n\n* **Simply RSVP Yes\, [purchase](https://m
 y.tso.ca/3675/3786) your ticket and post your seat number and I will move 
 you to attending.**\n* If you plan to buy RUSH\, please state that in your
  RSVP\, so I can include you in the reminder and we can meet you.\n* RSVPs
  close 2 days prior\, and cancellations after will result in a No Show and
  impact future attendance.\n* A reminder will go out the day before with m
 y cell and details when to meet\, etc.\n\n‐‐----‐----‐‐---------
 ----‐-----------\n**MEETUP TIME**\n**Meet me at 7:15pm** **at Roy Thomso
 n Hall at 60 Simcoe St.\, inside the southern-most double set of glass doo
 rs\, after scanning your tickets.**\n\n**Start time: 7:30pm**\n\nLength: 2
  hours (includes intermission)\n\nAfter: please meet me at the initial spo
 t to head out and chat about the show\n\nEnjoy and please post your Commen
 ts after!
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/experiencetoronto/events/314092375/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260402T182740Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260402T182740Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
