SUMMARY: New Music for Old Hands Concert Series: Alex Eddington
DESCRIPTION:Matinee concert series at Labdara Lithuanian Nursing Home. Ea
 ch concert in this series will premiere a composition performed by the La
 bdara bell choir and Laura Gillis (conductor/pianist). Each composer will
  give a talk and share music with the residents and audience members\, fo
 llowed by a casual social mixer.\n\n2:00pm start time. Free Admission. Re
 serve your spot at Eventbrite. Limited seating available.\n\nJune 13: Ale
 x Eddington\n\nComposer Alex Eddington will talk about his experience wit
 h collaborative composing\, and will share some music he wrote with youth
  and community ensembles. The Labdara bell choir and Laura Gillis (conduc
 tor/pianist) will premiere Alex's piece\, The First Song I Remember...\n\
 nJune 20: Martin van de Ven\n\nwww.facebook.com/NewMusicForOldHands http:
 //www.facebook.com/NewMusicForOldHands
CATEGORIES:Music,Concert,#poweredbyTAC,#BringingTheArtsToLife
