X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Toronto Public Library": "https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69bd51411868469f5fc39152"}
X-SOURCE-ID:tpl_events
SUMMARY:Pride Cookie Decorating with Jasper Bryan
DTSTART;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260618T200000Z
DTEND;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260618T210000Z
UID:69bd51411868469f5fc39152@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join Jasper\, an expressive arts therapist in the 2SLGBTQIA+ c
 ommunity\, for Pride cookie decorating at Toronto Public Library. Celebrat
 e Pride by getting creative and bringing home something sweet!\nJasper Bry
 an (he/they) is a queer expressive arts therapist\, facilitator\, artist\,
  and children's book author and illustrator. He is a leader in Toronto’s
  2SLGBTQIA+ community\, exploring the intersections of art and mental heal
 th to empower everybody. He loves glitter\, arts and crafts\, and rainbows
 !\nYou can access Jasper's picture book\, Pink & Blue\, at any TPL library
  branch. Pink & Blue is about finding community and being yourself.\nDon
 ’t forget to bring your sweet tooth!\nInformation Collection Notice:\nTh
 e personal information on this form is collected by the Toronto Public Lib
 rary under the Public Libraries Act\, sections 20(a)\, 20(c)\, and 20(d). 
 The information will only be used for event and program registration\, del
 ivery and evaluation. Questions about how the library handles your informa
 tion can be directed to Answerline staff at\nanswerline@tpl.ca\n\, 416-397
 -5981\, 789 Yonge Street\, Toronto ON M4W 2G8.
LOCATION:S. Walter Stewart\, Meeting Room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69bd51411868469f5fc39152
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library
END:VEVENT
