UID:695ed5e71e64afd01e5313c1@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:This program is currently full.\nLooking for something to do a
 fter school? Come out to our After School Club and learn new things\, make
  stuff\, meet other kids and have fun! For ages\n6-12.\nSnacks are offered
  during the After School Club for participants. Ingredient lists will be a
 vailable. Snacks are generously supported\, in part\, by donors.\nInformat
 ion Collection Notice:\nThe personal information on this form is collected
  by the Toronto Public Library under the Public Libraries Act\, sections 2
 0(a)\, 20(c)\, and 20(d). The information will only be used for event and 
 program registration\, delivery and evaluation. Questions about how the li
 brary handles your information can be directed to Answerline staff at\nans
 werline@tpl.ca\n\, 416-397-5981\, 789 Yonge Street\, Toronto ON M4W 2G8.
LOCATION:Hillcrest\, Auditorium
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/695ed5e71e64afd01e5313c1
