DTEND;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260626T210000Z
UID:69544942491b809c6f1012a7@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Whether you're a new or expert Pokémon Trainer\, everyone is 
 welcome! Show off your Pokémon knowledge and research skills and join our
  exciting Pokémon scavenger hunt for free Pokémon cards!\nFeel free to b
 ring in your old Pokémon cards to play with or trade with staff and other
  Pokémon trainers!
LOCATION:York Woods\, Program Room - Basement
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69544942491b809c6f1012a7
