SUMMARY:FUN Friday
DTSTART;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260626T200000Z
DTEND;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260626T210000Z
UID:699df6be8089f23c675ddc7f@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Come join us to celebrate the end of the week with games\, cra
 fts\, snap circuits and so much more!\nAges 6-12
LOCATION:Amesbury Park\, Program Room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/699df6be8089f23c675ddc7f
