X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Toronto Public Library": "https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/699caa1581b67dfe32a84ef3"}
X-SOURCE-ID:tpl_events
SUMMARY:Chess Club
DTSTART;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260626T210000Z
DTEND;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260626T230000Z
UID:699caa1581b67dfe32a84ef3@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us at the Bloor/Gladstone Library to play chess with frie
 nds\, family\, and fellow enthusiasts!\nPlayers of all ages and strengths 
 are welcome\, no previous experience is required.\nDrop in. No registratio
 n required.
LOCATION:Bloor/Gladstone\, Program Room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/699caa1581b67dfe32a84ef3
