DESCRIPTION:Join us for a day of fun and crafts. Partake in a new and enga
 ging craft every Saturday from 9:30am - 4:30pm.\nDrop-in and self-serve. F
 or pre-school and school-aged children and their caregivers.\nIf your chil
 d lives with a disability\, and requires an accessibility accommodation to
  participate in this program\, please contact Accessibility Services at ac
 cessibleservices@tpl.ca or phone 416-393-7099. Please contact us at least 
 three weeks in advance.
