DTEND;TZID="UTC-04:00";VALUE=DATE-TIME:20261003T100000
UID:fc9c2a723d831ff491b56bf7fc3a6067@toronto.ca
DESCRIPTION:Fleeting moments and beauty of urban life captured through wat
 ercolour\, oils\, and gouache paintings that invite viewers to pause\, con
 nect and slow down to reflect beautifully in memory. Anchored in connectio
 n\, this exhibition by Dinesh Subramanian and Isabel Fryszberg preserves t
 he essence of human interwovenness.\nCategories: Arts/Exhibits\, Artisan\n
 Free event
LOCATION:Assembly Hall Gallery\, 1 Colonel Samuel Smith Park Dr\, Etobicok
 e\, ON\, M8V 4B6
